1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,666
Arif spent years building a portfolio rebalancing strategy.

2
00:00:02,666 --> 00:00:05,583
He wants to sell it, but the moment he shares the rules, anyone can copy them.

3
00:00:05,583 --> 00:00:09,916
Sari wants the best plan for her portfolio, but she won't hand her balances and positions to a stranger.

4
00:00:09,916 --> 00:00:11,958
So the expertise never meets the data.

5
00:00:11,958 --> 00:00:12,733
Until now.

